sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant SA as SalesAgent
  participant G as ToolGateway
  participant CAT as Catalogue
  participant CRM as CRM
  C->>S: Change my plan to 5G Ultra Max
  S->>SA: handle
  SA->>G: catalog.check_eligibility
  G->>CAT: eligibility and price
  SA-->>C: Price, and warning if legacy terms are lost. Confirm?
  C->>S: YES
  G->>CRM: plan.change
  CRM-->>G: ok
  G->>CRM: read back current plan
  alt plan matches
    G-->>C: Done. Your plan is now 5G Ultra Max
  else mismatch
    G-->>C: Could not verify the change. Specialist notified.
  end
